了不同的发型和配饰。人行道由浅灰色混凝土板制成。整体场景是都市和休闲的，重点是街头时尚和个人风格。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [507.6446533203125, 369.95562744140625], "pos": [2623.8046875, 81.1817398071289], "id": 31, "properties": {}, "order": 10}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "size": [369.9968566894531, 508.0722961425781], "pos": [2213.46630859375, 720.0437622070312], "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"name": "source", "link": 17, "label": "source", "type": "*", "localized_name": "源"}], "flags": {}, "id": 23, "type": "PreviewAny", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PreviewAny"}, "order": 21}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "size": [369.9968566894531, 508.0722961425781], "pos": [2203.397705078125, 1365.4024658203125], "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"name": "source", "link": 21, "label": "source", "type": "*", "localized_name": "源"}], "flags": {}, "id": 27, "type": "PreviewAny", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PreviewAny"}, "order": 22}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["Photograph of a narrow, rocky canyon with a small, clear waterfall at the center. A wooden bridge with a red railing runs horizontally across the left side, supported by concrete pillars. The canyon walls are steep and covered in lush green foliage, with trees and shrubs densely packed. The foreground features a rocky stream bed with variously sized, smooth stones in shades of beige, gray, and brown. The water is clear, cascading over the rocks and flowing into a small pool. The background shows the canyon extending upwards, with more greenery and rock formations. The image has a natural, serene atmosphere.\n\n一张狭窄的岩石峡谷的照片，中心有一个小而清澈的瀑布。一座有红色栏杆的木桥水平地横跨左侧，由混凝土柱支撑。峡谷壁陡峭，覆盖着郁郁葱葱的绿叶，树木和灌木密密麻麻。前景以岩石河床为特色，河床上有各种大小、光滑的米色、灰色和棕色石头。水清澈见底，从岩石上倾泻而下，流入一个小水池。背景显示峡谷向上延伸，有更多的植被和岩层。这张照片有一种自然、宁静的氛围。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [600.5335083007812, 382.666748046875], "pos": [2642.493896484375, 1377.8271484375], "id": 33, "properties": {}, "order": 11}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["This is a high-quality photograph of a young Asian woman modeling lingerie on a fashion runway. She has long, straight, dark brown hair that flows freely around her shoulders. Her skin is fair and smooth, and she has a slender, petite physique with small breasts. She is wearing a delicate, beige lace lingerie set that includes a sheer, underwire bra with intricate lace detailing and matching high-waisted panties that have lace trim at the sides. The lingerie is semi-transparent, revealing the natural shape of her body underneath. She accessorizes with a silver necklace featuring multiple small, sparkling pendants, and she wears small, elegant earrings. Her makeup is subtle, with a focus on natural tones that highlight her youthful features. She walks confidently down the runway with a slight smile, her right arm relaxed by her side and her left arm slightly bent. The background is dark, with a spotlight shining down on her, creating a dramatic contrast that emphasizes her figure. The runway is illuminated with bright lights, and a few blurred figures of spectators can be seen in the background, sitting on either side. The image has a watermark in the top left corner with Chinese characters.\n\n这是一张高质量的照片，一位年轻的亚洲女性在时装秀上为内衣做模特。她有一头又长又直的深棕色头发，在肩膀上自由地飘扬。她的皮肤白皙光滑，身材苗条，胸部小。她穿着一套精致的米色蕾丝内衣，包括一个带有复杂蕾丝细节的透明钢圈胸罩和两侧有蕾丝镶边的高腰内裤。内衣是半透明的，露出了她身体下面的自然形状。她戴着一条银项链，上面有多个闪闪发光的小吊坠，还戴着小巧优雅的耳环。她的妆容很微妙，注重自然色调，突出了她年轻的特征。她自信地走在T台上，微微一笑，右臂放在身边，左臂微微弯曲。背景是黑暗的，聚光灯照射在她身上，形成了一种戏剧性的对比，突显了她的身材。跑道被明亮的灯光照亮，背景中可以看到一些模糊的观众，他们坐在两边。图像左上角有一个水印，上面有汉字。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [553.5999755859375, 394.3999938964844], "pos": [2628.839111328125, 709.0194091796875], "id": 32, "properties": {}, "order": 12}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["The image shows a young woman standing in front of a brick wall with multiple photographs hanging on it. She is wearing a black strapless crop top and blue jeans with a high-waisted fit. She has a black crossbody bag slung over her shoulder and is holding a drink in her left hand. Her right hand is raised above her head, as if she is posing for the camera. The photographs on the wall behind her are of different women's faces and outfits. The woman has long dark hair and is looking directly at the camera with a serious expression.\n\n照片中，一位年轻女子站在砖墙前，墙上挂着多张照片。她穿着黑色无肩带露脐上衣和高腰蓝色牛仔裤。她肩上扛着一个黑色斜挎包，左手拿着一杯饮料。她的右手举过头顶，仿佛在对着镜头摆姿势。她身后墙上的照片是不同女性的脸和服装。这位女士有一头长长的黑发，表情严肃地直视着相机。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "title": "florence2", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [507.6446533203125, 369.95562744140625], "pos": [3178.41455078125, 77.57730102539062], "id": 34, "properties": {}, "order": 13}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["The image shows a model walking down a runway in a beige lingerie set. The model is wearing a strapless bodysuit with a sweetheart neckline and thin straps. The bodysuits are made of a sheer, lace-like material and have a high-waisted fit. She is also wearing a statement necklace and earrings. Her long dark hair is styled in loose waves and she is looking directly at the camera with a confident expression. The background is dark and there are people sitting on either side of the runway, watching the model.\n\n图片显示，一位模特穿着米色内衣走在T台上。这位模特穿着一件无肩带紧身衣，有一个甜心领口和细肩带。紧身衣由透明的蕾丝状材料制成，有高腰的合身感。她还戴着一条引人注目的项链和耳环。她深色的长发呈松散的波浪状，她自信地直视着镜头。背景是黑暗的，有人坐在跑道的两侧，看着模特。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "title": "florence2", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [507.6446533203125, 369.95562744140625], "pos": [3223.209228515625, 721.4573364257812], "id": 35, "properties": {}, "order": 14}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["The image shows a wooden bridge over a small stream in a mountainous area. The bridge is made of concrete and has a railing on both sides. The stream is flowing over rocks 